%% Title: Decision tree
%% Purpose: Show branching logic for a product or policy decision.
%% Assumptions:
%% - Branch labels should be mutually exclusive.
%% Open questions:
%% - Confirm fallback behavior for unknown inputs.
flowchart TD
    Start([Evaluate request]) --> Permission{Has permission?}
    Permission -- No --> Block[Show permission message]
    Permission -- Yes --> Complete{Required data complete?}
    Complete -- No --> Missing[Ask for missing details]
    Complete -- Yes --> Risk{Needs review?}
    Risk -- Yes --> Review[Route to reviewer]
    Risk -- No --> Approve[Auto-approve]
    Review --> Approved{Reviewer approves?}
    Approved -- Yes --> Approve
    Approved -- No --> Reject[Return with reason]
